.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-25T08:26:55-07:00","id":240312,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/237721-what-happens-when-an-analyst-goes-loud?p=240140#post240140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, people use <i>Embeds</i> when they go loud? Kinda goes against the purpose, doesn't it? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>If transforming into a horrific mechanoid angel-monster with the power of Hell isn't a time for subtlety, then I honestly don't know what is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-25T10:32:30-07:00","id":240375,"title":"","content":"For the one who didn't want to read a pdf, the recent fiction publications have been made available in mobi and epub format, which is fantastic cause I have a hard time reading pdfs lately.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-25-2014, 01:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T01:07:20-07:00","id":241171,"title":"","content":"Two things that I feel could have been added to the Analyst write up -<br /> <br /> 1) The topic of this thread - What happens when they go loud. Answer - All Embeds that belong to the same category as the first key in the Analyst Cipher. <br /> <br /> 2) The write up mentions that Analysts are a bit better with Gadget creation. Yet as written they have no bonus to creating Gadgets? Maybe a +1 or +2 bonus to Gadget creation rolls could represent that?<br /> <br /> I was thinking of asking if these two things could be added in the errata thread (since they would require a sentence each to add to the write up, not such a huge change that it would alter the pdf/doc hugely), but I wanted to voice the idea here first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T16:21:05-07:00","id":241793,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hawthorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/237721-what-happens-when-an-analyst-goes-loud?p=241171#post241171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2) The write up mentions that Analysts are a bit better with Gadget creation. Yet as written they have no bonus to creating Gadgets? Maybe a +1 or +2 bonus to Gadget creation rolls could represent that?.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm honestly not thrilled with that. It's unprecedented with any other Incarnation, and it makes Analysts objectively better (albeit only slightly) than any of the original four.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T16:35:38-07:00","id":241811,"title":"","content":"Perhaps then it might be good to just leave that vaguely stated. I'd be inclined to give the other incarnations context sensitive bonuses on stuff.<br /> <br /> I'm actually sort of tempted to do it with regards to the Embed category they show an affinity for. A +1 to it. Small but nice. Could be that Analysts get that +1 to their Exploit use as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":159,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","user":"Leetsepeak","date":". 08-26-2014, 07:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T17:32:13-07:00","id":241834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/237721-what-happens-when-an-analyst-goes-loud?p=241793#post241793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm honestly not thrilled with that. It's unprecedented with any other Incarnation, and it makes Analysts objectively better (albeit only slightly) than any of the original four.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Having a +1 to create gadgets makes them objectively better than the other four Incarnations? I guess if &quot;better&quot; means &quot;has the most dice absent all other contexts,&quot; but is that really the best metric?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T17:54:03-07:00","id":241862,"title":"","content":"I do want to take a moment to be pleased with Analysts. I'd been wanting to make a character that was an Observer like they suggest for a long time, but I felt awkward about making them some kind of Information Psychopomp. While I think the nature of the Analyst description really drives home how the Incarnations are merely an attempt to categorize Demons by Demons, it's still cool to have a way of expressing that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T18:00:42-07:00","id":241863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/237721-what-happens-when-an-analyst-goes-loud?p=241811#post241811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perhaps then it might be good to just leave that vaguely stated. I'd be inclined to give the other incarnations context sensitive bonuses on stuff.<br /> <br /> I'm actually sort of tempted to do it with regards to the Embed category they show an affinity for. A +1 to it. Small but nice. Could be that Analysts get that +1 to their Exploit use as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would prolly agree to leave it open ended and let the situation handle what effect it has. I'd probably use it as extra leeway when they try to get Exploits with Embeds that may not initially make sense till they describe one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T22:00:37-07:00","id":241977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/237721-what-happens-when-an-analyst-goes-loud?p=241834#post241834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Having a +1 to create gadgets makes them objectively better than the other four Incarnations? I guess if &quot;better&quot; means &quot;has the most dice absent all other contexts,&quot; but is that really the best metric?</div> </div> </div> </div>It irks me.<br /> <br /> The Incarnations are extremely cosmetic in terms of mechanics. The effect is confined to role-playing the character: Is your Destroyer a dyed in the wool killer, a committed pacifist or something in-between? The rulebook says Destroyers have an easier time using Cacophony Embeds but the rules do not reflect this beyond a single embed selected at character creation. Otherwise, the price for entry is the same (2 xp per embed), and the rules are the same: Finesse attribute + Skill. Any Incarnation can pick up Cacophony Embeds, combat skills, relevant form abilities, and a few of the more lethal Exploits and <i>voil\u00e0</i>, you have a bruiser.<br /> <br /> I'm aware that +1 to making gadgets is supremely trivial, but it gives a mechanical support to Analysts that the other Incarnations don't have any equivalent to. If a gadget making proficiency was something Analysts had <i>in lieu</i> of getting Embeds during Going Loud, I'd withdraw my objection (maybe raise the bonus to +2 or +3).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T02:52:00-07:00","id":242110,"title":"","content":"LOL, going Loud in order to make a Gadget.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T12:28:45-07:00","id":622536,"title":"","content":"I'd house rule that Analysts do not get all the Embeds of one category when Going Loud. Since they are supposed to be good with Exploits, I'd say Analysts get 8 Again on Exploit rolls when Going Loud. I know that sounds really powerful, but you could emphasize that these jacked up Exploits cannot be dialed down, and thus whatever Condition you get will be even worse. I'd represent their affinity for Gadgets not with dice bonuses. Instead, Aetheric Resonance is diminished when you have an Analyst nearby as you build a Gadget. This diminished Aetheric Resonance does not occur if the Analyst is building the Gadget himself. They are the Eyes, after all, not Wheels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T08:16:17-07:00","id":623324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/237721-what-happens-when-an-analyst-goes-loud?p=242110#post242110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">LOL, going Loud in order to make a Gadget.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;The Scouter says he's OVER <b>NINE</b>-wait, is that a glowing ball-point pen?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T20:09:24-07:00","id":623890,"title":"","content":"I honestly have some players who would be mad enough to actually go loud in order to make a Gadget they really wanted. Might give you the edge you need to make that 2nd Order Lambda too. But the image is fantastic.<br /> <br /> But goddamn I would make them suffer the consequences of their hubris. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-12T03:29:11-07:00","id":624043,"title":"","content":"Making a lambda is crazy flashy as it is. Going Loud to do the same is the equivalent of asking the G-M to call down a nuclear strike.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-12T03:34:42-07:00","id":624047,"title":"","content":"They glow a very specific colour, not visible to non-magically touched human beings, which is Essence refracting light. We might call it... <i>Octarine.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}